                <pb facs="0371" n="289" xml:id="pg289"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/647.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the American Minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August 13,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to legation’s August 12, Mr. Knox informs Mr. Furniss that the
                    Department considers it most important to have the assurances referred to made
                    to him in writing.</p>
            </div>
